ed":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3981-rickmanuk","name":"RickmanUK","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"533"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-24T22:36:31-07:00","id":567450,"title":"","content":"Lets see what we've got...<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5ieUQxZQXrg\" target=\"_blank\">I Will Never Die</a> by Delta Rae - Good for the WoD in general, but I like the thought of an Incarnate Beast singing it.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G4P8d04H1tw\" target=\"_blank\">Haze</a> by Device - Listen to this and try to tell me it doesn't sound like a Beast who's far too hungry or just doesn't care anymore.<br /> <i>&quot;I'm not the only one. Learn a little lesson from me<br /> I'm a Leviathan, focused on fulfilling a need<br /> The faint of heart observe the bolder ones setting the bar<br /> A feeding frenzy when the starving just forget where they are&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/X-2yuGgp_U8\" target=\"_blank\">Lift Me Up</a> by Five Finger Death Punch - Fed up Anakim, anyone?<br /> <br /> I'm sure I'll think of a half dozen more when I'm not sleep deprived.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sisyphus has it easy...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1647-mechalith","name":"Mechalith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1647_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-20T05:48:20-08:00","id":769894,"title":"","content":"Necromancy!.... Di