/forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 11-27-2015, 09:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-27T09:37:53-08:00","id":775519,"title":"","content":"Heroes think that their theme songs are <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OBwS66EBUcY\" target=\"_blank\"><b>&quot;I Need A Hero&quot;</b></a> and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=blx7u7PVbZI\" target=\"_blank\"><b>&quot;Everybody Loves Me&quot;</b></a>, but their theme songs are actually <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s7wCnBm9gsc\" target=\"_blank\"><b>&quot;Where's The Dragon?&quot;</b></a> and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WL_svZmiGWw\" target=\"_blank\"><b>&quot;Zero The Hero&quot;</b></a>.<br /> <br /> As for Beasts themselves, I like <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vYR7Q-466Bw\" target=\"_blank\"><b>&quot;Pet The Destroyer&quot;</b></a> (Ravagers), <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mZ2ZWLXvZ3Y\" target=\"_blank\"><b>&quot;Everything Burns&quot;</b></a> (Ravagers/Nemeses), <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OmGLmwOLKwQ\" target=\"_blank\"><b>&quot;Plastic Soul&quot;</b></a> (Tyrants/Collectors), <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SXpnI52cLEc\" target=\"_blank\"><b>&quot;Oh Death&quot;</b></a> (Predators), <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v5yeMgvdo_E\" target=\"_blank\"><b>&quot;God's Gonna Cut You Down&quot;</b></a> (Nemeses) and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lOloCN0Y7DA\" target=\"_blank\"><b>&quot;Such A Gorey Demise&quot;</b></a> (Predators/Collectors). Last but not least, there's <a href=\"http://www.azlyrics.com/lyrics/manman/hautetropique.html\" target=\"_blank\"><b>&quot;Haute Tropique&quot;</b></a>, which sounds like a Predator/Collector who's (almost) fully accepted his new life as a monster, but can apply to many Beasts and even other splats.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-27T10:13:25-08:00","id":775531,"title":"","content":"EDIT: Sorry about the triple post. See the post above for my suggestions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 11-27-2015, 09:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-27T10:19:03-08:00","id":775533,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>Apologies., GottaGoFeast. Attempts at spamtrapping. You have done nothing wrong. It is the number of links that triggered it. I should have it restored.</b></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum