gh that band has a few good ones actually as I'm also using <a href=\"https://youtu.be/LSvOTw8UH6s\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Demons&quot;</a> from the same album as a theme song for my Makara Siren right now. The latter song works best if you think of it as being sung to his Horror as a sort of thanks for freeing him from his old life.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3139-rayn-faustus","name":"Rayn Faustus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3139_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T12:23:49-08:00","id":782998,"title":"","content":"Florence + The Machine's &quot;Seven Devils&quot; tends to be my go to theme for Beast (Or specifically a beast with pyromaniac tendencies)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10141-solaris","name":"Solaris","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10141_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T19:01:42-08:00","id":784485,"title":"","content":"Two rihanna tracks<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EHkozMIXZ8w\" data-code=\"EHkozMIXZ8w\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/EHkozMIXZ8w/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div> - T