ttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BQDoIzNKVSY\" target=\"_blank\">You Should Know Where I'm Coming From by Banks</a> was the near-central-theme of Beast.<br /> <br /> I like that song, and I don't disagree with it's assessment. And in particular, I think it very strongly embodies where a young Beast starts. I think it owns the prices paid in becoming who you are. I actually really love this song.<br /> <br /> But if you want a look at how <i>I</i> feel about Beast, that is a singularly understandable and condemnable point of view, that is Beast <i>in the long game</i> and <i>grand view </i> is.<br /> <br /> Then allow me to point you at The Monster by Eminem:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HpjAZViu9Gw\" data-code=\"HpjAZViu9Gw\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/HpjAZViu9Gw/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T22:11:19-07:00","id":1399507,"title":"","content":"Also, Hey Look Ma, I Made It by Panic! at the Disco (Featuring currently <i>only</i> Brendon Urie of Panic! at the Disco) is i